    seo="The Squonk, Pennsylvania’s Saddest Cryptid | Dorian Bailey",
    desc="The Squonk, the weeping cryptid of Pennsylvania’s hemlock forests: where the legend began in 1910, how it spread, and why the saddest creature still endures.",
    standfirst="A small, warty, endlessly weeping creature of the hemlock woods, first written down in 1910 and still being retold.",
